{"base_rate":0.32588699080157685,"brier":0.13806990801576874,"bss":0.37150865245551135,"bss_hi":0.44959734721980665,"bss_lo":0.2975920669560432,"chart":{"base":[484.6,56.8],"fp":[276.6,312.5],"lead":"62,229.1 272,208 482,156.8 692,103.8","note":{"base":"skill 0.37 — higher than 70% of cities","fp":"low end +7pp, high end +13pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.3 °C — better than 25% of cities","rel":"promised 0% → rained 4%; promised 94% → rained 79%"},"rel":"62,448.1 116.2,372.3 358.2,244.2 654.9,125.4"},"country":"RO","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.08412614980289096,"ess":407.99003963220827,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Cluj-Napoca</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Cluj-Napoca rain forecast is genuinely useful, though 5 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>87%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>4%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 761 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-30. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nCLUJ NAPOCA, 3.1 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.37, ranked 63 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(37&ndash;103) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>4%</b></td><td class='num'>289</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>4%</td><td class='num'><b>15%</b></td><td class='num'>78</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>13%</td><td class='num'><b>27%</b></td><td class='num'>88</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>33%</td><td class='num'><b>40%</b></td><td class='num'>75</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>61%</td><td class='num'><b>63%</b></td><td class='num'>75</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>88%</td><td class='num'><b>70%</b></td><td class='num'>73</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>87%</b></td><td class='num'>83</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">5 of 7 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Cluj-Napoca</b> <span class=\"muted\">Romania</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag good\">Genuinely useful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">5 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.37</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>37&ndash;103\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>761 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Cluj-Napoca &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Cluj-Napoca\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"58.0,382.0 71.07076923076923,349.3333333333333 103.81886363636363,307.54545454545456 176.14159999999998,216.98666666666668 272.76,119.92000000000002 369.9079452054794,37.945205479452056 409.8674698795182,18.0 409.8674698795182,26.771084337349407 369.9079452054794,87.8082191780822 272.76,202.42666666666665 176.14159999999998,299.49333333333334 103.81886363636363,357.1818181818182 71.07076923076923,382.0 58.0,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"263.37713534822603\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"263.37713534822603\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.0,366.88581314878894 71.07076923076923,326.0 103.81886363636363,282.72727272727275 176.14159999999998,236.4 272.76,153.89333333333332 369.9079452054794,127.69863013698628 409.8674698795182,66.24096385542168\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 4% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 289 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.0\" cy=\"366.88581314878894\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 4%&amp;#10;It rained 15% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"71.07076923076923\" cy=\"326.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 13%&amp;#10;It rained 27% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 88 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"103.81886363636363\" cy=\"282.72727272727275\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 33%&amp;#10;It rained 40% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"176.14159999999998\" cy=\"236.4\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 61%&amp;#10;It rained 63% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"272.76\" cy=\"153.89333333333332\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 88%&amp;#10;It rained 70% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 73 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"369.9079452054794\" cy=\"127.69863013698628\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 87% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 83 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"409.8674698795182\" cy=\"66.24096385542168\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(33%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Cluj-Napoca the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.44) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.30).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>31%</td><td class='num'>0.302</td><td class='num'>10.2%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>34%</td><td class='num'>0.326</td><td class='num'>10.9%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>217</td><td class='num'>31%</td><td class='num'>0.407</td><td class='num'>5.4%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>34%</td><td class='num'>0.440</td><td class='num'>7.1%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":46.76667,"lon":23.6,"n":761,"n_cities":213,"name":"Cluj-Napoca","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0,"n":289,"obs":0.04152249134948097,"sig":true},{"hi":0.08,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.036923076923076906,"n":78,"obs":0.15384615384615385,"sig":true},{"hi":0.23,"lo":0.08,"mean":0.12943181818181818,"n":88,"obs":0.2727272727272727,"sig":true},{"hi":0.48,"lo":0.23,"mean":0.3337333333333333,"n":75,"obs":0.4,"sig":false},{"hi":0.78,"lo":0.48,"mean":0.6066666666666667,"n":75,"obs":0.6266666666666667,"sig":false},{"hi":0.98,"lo":0.78,"mean":0.8810958904109588,"n":73,"obs":0.6986301369863014,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.98,"mean":0.9939759036144582,"n":83,"obs":0.8674698795180723,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":3.1,"provisional":false,"rank":63,"rank_hi":103.02499999999998,"rank_lo":37.0,"reliability":0.00984187445665209,"resolution":0.08884521184487124,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"cluj-napoca","station":"CLUJ NAPOCA","timezone":"Europe/Bucharest"}